  "topic_en": "Gauss derives product formulas for theta-type series in x^{n^2} (sums over squares of odd numbers, x+x^9+x^25+..., and x^3+x^27+x^75+...) from earlier formulas 23, 24 and 26 by substituting it for x and iy for y, obtaining formulas [54]–[61].",
  "transcription": "226\n\nund das Product\n\n[54] $\\left((1-2x^3)^2+(1-2x)^2\\right)\\left((1+2x^3)^2+(1+2x)^2\\right)=\\frac{4[x^6]^8}{[x^{12}]^4}=4(1-2x^6+2x^{24}\\ldots)^4$\n\nAus Formel 23 folgt\n\n[55] $x+x^9+x^{25}+\\&c.=x(1+x^8)(1+x^{16})(1+x^{24})\\ldots\\{1-x^{16}-x^{32}+x^{80}+x^{112}\\ \\&c.\\}$\n$\\frac{3}{2}$ Exponenten [?] $=\\Box-1$\n\nAus Formel 26 folgt\n\n[56] $x^3+x^{27}+x^{75}+\\&c=x(1+x^8)(1+x^{16})(1+x^{24})\\ldots\\{x^2-x^{10}-x^{42}+x^{66}+x^{130}-\\&c.\\}$\noder $x^{\\frac{1}{3}}(1+x^8)(1+x^{16})(1+x^{24})=A$\n$x^2=t^3$ gesetzt\n\n[55] $x+x^9+x^{25}+\\&c=A(t-t^{25}-t^{49}+t^{121}+t^{169}\\ldots)$\n[56] $x^3+x^{27}+x^{75}+\\&c=A(t^4-t^{16}-t^{64}+t^{100}+t^{196}\\ldots)$\nNun folgt aus der factorenzerlegung in 24 schlechthin [?], wenn man statt x, it statt y, iy setzt\n[-$t-\\frac{t^4}{y}-t^{16}y+$-]\n$it-it^4+it^{16}-it^{25}-it^{49}\\ldots=it(1-t^3)(1+t^{15})(1+t^{21})(1+t^{33})\\ldots(1+t^{18})(1-t^{36})(1+t^{54})\\ldots$\nAlso aus 55–56\n\n[57] $(x+x^9+x^{25})-(x^3+x^{27}+x^{75})=x(1-xx)(1-x^{10})(1+x^{14})(1+x^{22})(1-x^{26})\\ldots(1+x^{12})(1-x^{24})(1+x^{36})\\ldots(1+x^8)(1+x^{16})(1+x^{24})\\ldots$\nUnd so schlechthin [?]\n\n[58] $(x+x^9+x^{25}\\ldots)+(x^3+x^{27}+x^{75})=x(1+xx)(1+x^{10})(1-x^{14})(1-x^{22})(1+x^{26})\\ldots(1+x^{12})(1-x^{24})(1+x^{36})\\ldots(1+x^8)(1+x^{16})\\ldots$\nAlso durch Multiplication\n\n[59] $(x+x^9+x^{25}\\ldots)^2-(x^3+x^{27}+x^{75})^2=xx(1-x^4)(1-x^{20})(1-x^{28})(1-x^{44})(1-x^{52})\\ldots(1+x^{12})^2(1-x^{24})^2(1+x^{36})^2\\ldots(1+x^8)^2(1+x^{16})^2\\ldots$\n$=\\frac{x\\,[x^4][x^{16}]^2[x^{24}]^7}{[x^8]^3[x^{12}]^3[x^{48}]^2}$\n\nEben so folgt aus der factorenzerlegung in 24 wenn man statt x, t und statt y, iy setzt\n$t+it^4-it^{16}-t^{25}-t^{49}\\ldots=t(1+it^3)(1-it^{15})(1+it^{21})(1-it^{33})\\ldots[t^{18}]$ also\n\n[60] $(x+x^9+x^{25}\\ldots)+i(x^3+x^{27}+x^{75}+\\&c)=x(1+ixx)(1-ix^{10})(1+ix^{14})(1-ix^{22})\\ldots(1+x^8)(1+x^{16})\\ldots(1-x^{12})(1-x^{24})\\ldots$\nu. eben so\n[61] $(x+x^9+x^{25}\\ldots)-i(x^3+x^{27}+x^{75}+\\&c)=x(1-ixx)(1+ix^{10})(1-ix^{14})(1+ix^{22})\\ldots(1+x^8)(1+x^{16})\\ldots(1-x^{12})(1-x^{24})\\ldots$",
